@ Pokemonlevidi -- "Red" story layer: all text.
@ NEW FILE. Included from data/event_scripts.s after the scripts include.
@ Two lines per text box, \p = new page, \l = scroll within the same box.
@ ===========================================================================

@ --- 1. Opening: her bedroom ------------------------------------------------

LevidiRed_Text_Opening1:
	.string "Eleven days.\p"
	.string "Eleven days since RED walked out of\n"
	.string "LITTLEROOT in a jacket and the\l"
	.string "wrong shoes for the weather.$"

LevidiRed_Text_Opening2:
	.string "Nobody here says his name out loud.\p"
	.string "They call him that boy, and then\n"
	.string "they look at the floor.\p"
	.string "So you have stopped asking them.$"

LevidiRed_Text_Opening3:
	.string "...Fine.\p"
	.string "The roads remember people.\n"
	.string "Roads are good at that.\p"
	.string "Eleven days is not so long, and\n"
	.string "somebody has to go and find him.$"

LevidiRed_Text_Opening4:
	.string "And you would like it to be you.\p"
	.string "You would like it very much.$"

@ --- 2. Oldale Town: the traveller -----------------------------------------

LevidiRed_Text_Traveller1:
	.string "Cold morning for walking.\p"
	.string "You've got a face like a search\n"
	.string "party, though. Am I right?$"

LevidiRed_Text_Traveller2:
	.string "A boy came through about ten days\n"
	.string "back. Red cap. No coat.\p"
	.string "He bought one potion and counted\n"
	.string "his coins twice.\p"
	.string "Then he stood in the road for a\n"
	.string "long while, like he'd lost the\l"
	.string "end of his own sentence.$"

LevidiRed_Text_Traveller3:
	.string "I asked where he was headed.\p"
	.string "He said west. Said the woods.\p"
	.string "Then he said sorry.\p"
	.string "Sorry! To me. Like I'd asked him\n"
	.string "for something.$"

LevidiRed_Text_Traveller4:
	.string "PETALBURG is west, past the\n"
	.string "flower fields.\p"
	.string "If he's still walking, he'll have\n"
	.string "stopped somewhere quiet by now.\p"
	.string "Boys like that always do.$"

LevidiRed_Text_TravellerEarly:
	.string "Cold morning for walking.\p"
	.string "Mind the road west. It's longer\n"
	.string "than it looks.$"

LevidiRed_Text_TravellerAgain:
	.string "West. Past the flower fields.\p"
	.string "Go on, before the light goes.$"

@ --- 3. Route 102: the cap --------------------------------------------------

LevidiRed_Text_Trace1:
	.string "Something red on the fence post.\p"
	.string "A cap.\p"
	.string "His cap.$"

LevidiRed_Text_Trace2:
	.string "Set down neatly, brim to the sky,\n"
	.string "the way you'd leave a thing you\l"
	.string "meant to come back for.\p"
	.string "The band inside is still damp.\p"
	.string "...Or the fog has been keeping it\n"
	.string "wet for him.\p"
	.string "You put it in your bag either way.$"

@ --- 4. Petalburg City: the gardener ---------------------------------------

LevidiRed_Text_Gardener1:
	.string "You're looking for someone.\p"
	.string "Don't look so startled. Everyone\n"
	.string "who comes down this street looking\l"
	.string "has the same face on.$"

LevidiRed_Text_Gardener2:
	.string "A boy sat on my wall a whole\n"
	.string "afternoon, in the rain.\p"
	.string "Wouldn't come in. Wouldn't go on.\p"
	.string "I gave him tea. He held the cup\n"
	.string "until it went cold, and then he\l"
	.string "said he didn't know how to go home.$"

LevidiRed_Text_Gardener3:
	.string "So I told him: then don't. Not yet.\n"
	.string "Go somewhere quiet first.\p"
	.string "He went north, into the woods, when\n"
	.string "the light was going.\p"
	.string "I've left my gate open since.$"

LevidiRed_Text_Gardener4:
	.string "Go on, then.\p"
	.string "Quiet is not the same as gone.$"

LevidiRed_Text_GardenerEarly:
	.string "The beds along this wall are mine.\n"
	.string "Mind where you step, dear.$"

LevidiRed_Text_GardenerAgain:
	.string "North, dear. The woods.\p"
	.string "Take a coat. It's cold in there.$"

@ --- 5. Petalburg Woods: the reunion ---------------------------------------

LevidiRed_Text_Reunion1:
	.string "RED is on the fallen trunk at the\n"
	.string "edge of the clearing, hunched,\l"
	.string "his hands in his lap.\p"
	.string "He doesn't look surprised.\p"
	.string "He looks tired of hoping.$"

LevidiRed_Text_Reunion2:
	.string "RED: ...You found me.\p"
	.string "RED: I didn't think anybody would.$"

LevidiRed_Text_Reunion3:
	.string "RED: I went out to prove something.\n"
	.string "Something stupid.\p"
	.string "I got as far as these trees, and\n"
	.string "the thing I was proving got\l"
	.string "smaller and smaller.\p"
	.string "Then it was just me and a cold\n"
	.string "forest, and the walk back looked\l"
	.string "very long.$"

LevidiRed_Text_Reunion4:
	.string "RED: Eleven days.\p"
	.string "Every morning I thought: tomorrow.\p"
	.string "And then it was eleven days, and\n"
	.string "tomorrow had got expensive.$"

LevidiRed_Text_ReunionCap:
	.string "You take the cap out of your bag.\p"
	.string "You don't say anything.\p"
	.string "He looks at it for a long time.\p"
	.string "RED: ...You kept it dry.$"

LevidiRed_Text_ReunionAsk:
	.string "RED: So.\p"
	.string "RED: What do we do now?$"

LevidiRed_Text_ReunionQuestion:
	.string "Come home with me.\p"
	.string "...Will you?$"

LevidiRed_Text_ReunionYes1:
	.string "He nods. Then he nods again, as\n"
	.string "if he's checking that it's allowed.\p"
	.string "RED: Okay.\p"
	.string "RED: Okay. But walk slow. I've been\n"
	.string "sitting a while.$"

LevidiRed_Text_ReunionYes2:
	.string "You go back through the trees with\n"
	.string "his hand in yours.\p"
	.string "Neither of you says anything the\n"
	.string "whole way.\p"
	.string "It takes a long time.\p"
	.string "Neither of you minds.$"

LevidiRed_Text_ReunionNo1:
	.string "He shakes his head.\p"
	.string "RED: Not yet.\p"
	.string "RED: I don't have the words for the\n"
	.string "front door yet. I'm sorry.$"

LevidiRed_Text_ReunionNo2:
	.string "...Okay.\p"
	.string "You sit down on the trunk beside\n"
	.string "him.\p"
	.string "The woods go on being dark and\n"
	.string "unhurried around the two of you.\p"
	.string "You stay.$"

LevidiRed_Text_WoodsLater:
	.string "RED: You came back.\p"
	.string "RED: I keep expecting you to get\n"
	.string "tired of the walk.\p"
	.string "...Sit. The trunk's still warm.$"

LevidiRed_Text_RedWoodsQuiet:
	.string "RED is quiet, and the trees are\n"
	.string "quiet, and that is enough for now.$"

@ --- 6. Littleroot Town: he came home --------------------------------------

LevidiRed_Text_Home1:
	.string "RED is outside the house with his\n"
	.string "hands in his pockets, watching\l"
	.string "the road like it might apologise.\p"
	.string "RED: Your mum's been out twice.\p"
	.string "RED: She keeps bringing me things.\l"
	.string "I think she thinks I'll go again.$"

LevidiRed_Text_Home2:
	.string "RED: I'm not going to.\p"
	.string "...You believe him.\p"
	.string "That is, as far as you can tell,\n"
	.string "the whole of coming home.$"

LevidiRed_Text_HomeRepeat:
	.string "RED: Still here.\p"
	.string "RED: Go on. I'll be here when you\n"
	.string "get back.\p"
	.string "...He says it like a fact.$"
